  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3212.03 Deduction of Allowances",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3212.03 Deduction of Allowances. Regardless of the request for deductions submitted pursuant to Env-A 3212.02, the NATS administrator shall deduct a number of allowances equal to the current control period NOx emissions from the budget source’s compliance account or overdraft account, and determine whether sufficient allowances are in the account equivalent to the emissions.\n\nSource. #11001, eff 1-1-16; ss by #14632, eff 6-25-26, EXPIRES: 6-25-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a3200.html"
}
